SmartSessionLens::getPermissionId
├── when called with a session
│   └── it returns a non-zero permission id
├── when called with sessions having different salts
│   └── it returns different permission ids
├── when called with sessions having different validators
│   └── it returns different permission ids
├── when called with the same session multiple times
│   └── it returns the same permission id
└── it is a pure function (deterministic)